WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.700
The live board: every guard at a glance.

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.190
The top row shows who's performing, who's on deck, and who's in the hole.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:15.097
Each card shows the guard and the props separately, with the last step and how long ago.

00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:18.348
Once they leave warm-up together, it's one Unit chip.

00:00:18.548 --> 00:00:24.170
Admins and the homeroom coordinator see the guide on each guard, with call and text.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:34.130
Red means something is late, like a guard not in warm-up by its warm-up time. It also turns red if a guard leaves before its homeroom is cleared.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.580
The line in red says exactly what's late.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:47.230
The director line shows check-in. Only admins with Director contact see their number; everyone else goes through the coordinators.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:55.050
Put the board on a TV or tablet at headquarters. It refreshes by itself every fifteen seconds.
